    "",
    "Every §9 URL is listed here. `built` controls whether a link renders:",
    "false means the page does not exist yet and the header skips it, so the",
    "live nav never contains a dead link. Create the page, flip the flag, and",
    "the link appears — no template edit.",
    "",
    "`primary` is the header nav. `secondary` holds the rest of §9 so the URLs",
    "are declared once and are ready for the footer, sitemap, and link map.",
    "",
    "/lead-paint-removal/ is deliberately absent. §2.6 blocks building, linking",
    "to, or referencing it until the real EPA RRP firm number is supplied.",
    "",
    "Guarded by scripts/check-nav.mjs: any built:true URL missing from dist/",
    "fails the build."
